\textbf{2} \textbf{Results in fuzzy designs}

In this section, the research design may be fuzzy: the treatment may
vary within (\emph{g, t}) cells. For instance, Enikolopov et al. (2011)
study the effect of having access to an independent TV channel in
Russia, and in each Russian region some people have access to that
channel while other people do not.

