proving the theorem.

\textbf{Lemma S2} \emph{If Assumptions 1-5 and S2 hold,}\\
\emph{E} (\emph{Yg,t\textbar{}\textbf{D}}) \emph{−E}
(\emph{Yg,t−}1\emph{\textbar{}\textbf{D}}) \emph{−}(\emph{E}
